    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "I recently migrated from vim-easy-align to mini.align; thanks for the amazing plugins! It's working out of the box for my use case, except for one minor detail that's confusing me. When I align a table on `&`, all the columns are shrunk to the smallest possible width, except the first column is much larger than expected. See screenshot:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/8164679/5b57e82b-1032-4d99-aeea-abf095d5775d)\r\n\r\nI apologize if this question has been answered in other documentation",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I recently migrated from vim-easy-align to mini.align; thanks for the amazing plugins! It's working out of the box for my use case, except for one minor detail that's confusing me. When I align a table on <code class=\"notranslate\">&amp;</code>, all the columns are shrunk to the smallest possible width, except the first column is much larger than expected. See screenshot:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/8164679/238677195-5b57e82b-1032-4d99-aeea-abf095d5775d.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..6gvXbd5kenWy7vhCj_TvwKoDed83H-tn3E7kYZ897yw\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/8164679/238677195-5b57e82b-1032-4d99-aeea-abf095d5775d.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..6gvXbd5kenWy7vhCj_TvwKoDed83H-tn3E7kYZ897yw\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I apologize if this question has been answered in other documentation</p>",
    "bodyText": "I recently migrated from vim-easy-align to mini.align; thanks for the amazing plugins! It's working out of the box for my use case, except for one minor detail that's confusing me. When I align a table on &, all the columns are shrunk to the smallest possible width, except the first column is much larger than expected. See screenshot:\n\nI apologize if this question has been answered in other documentation",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
